  "fullDescription": "Retro Pica is a bold and playful retro display font inspired by the nostalgic character of classic vintage typography. With its chunky letterforms, soft curves, decorative details, and unmistakable retro personality, Retro Pica is designed to make headlines, logos, and branding instantly stand out.\nPerfect for creating eye-catching retro branding, café and diner identities, food packaging, vintage labels, posters, album artwork, apparel designs, stickers, badges, merchandise, social media graphics, and lifestyle branding.\nIts expressive display style works especially well when you want a design to feel nostalgic, cheerful, bold, authentic, and memorable.\nPerfect For\n– Retro & Vintage Branding\n– Café & Diner Logos\n– Food & Beverage Packaging\n– Vintage Product Labels\n– Restaurant & Bakery Branding\n– Music Posters & Album Artwork\n– T-Shirt & Apparel Designs\n– Stickers & Merchandise\n– Posters & Advertising\n– Boutique & Lifestyle Branding\n– Social Media Graphics\n– Signage & Promotional Designs\nFont Details\n– Font Name: Retro Pica\n– Style: Retro Display / Vintage / Decorative\n– File Format: OTF Only\n– Works On: Windows\n– Use: Logos, branding, packaging, posters, apparel, labels, merchandise & more\nRetro Pica brings a strong nostalgic personality to any creative project and is an excellent choice for designers looking for a bold, distinctive vintage display font.",
